<span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-primary dark:text-primary-fixed-dim cursor-pointer active:scale-95 transition-transform">Oracle CRM Knowledge Base</span>
<nav class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-sm ml-lg">
</nav>
