<div class="text-right hidden sm:block">
<p class="font-label-md text-label-md text-secondary font-bold">System Status</p>
<p class="font-label-md text-label-md text-green-600 flex items-center justify-end gap-xs">
<span class="w-2 h-2 bg-green-600 rounded-full animate-pulse"></span>
Operational
</p>
</div>
</div>
